2. Payment Integrity
✅DONE ⚠️ [High] — Guest cancellation races payment confirmation (GuestBookingController.php:867) — Possible discrepancy: the cancel() method you shared with me already wraps its status check and update in DB::transaction() with lockForUpdate() on both the booking and the PaymentReference. Worth re-checking this against what's actually deployed — either the audit scanned a stale copy, or something reverted. Paste the current live cancel() method back to me and I'll confirm either way.

✅DONE ⚠️ [High] — QR Ph endpoint does not enforce payment_method = qrph (PaymongoQrPhController.php:37) — Same flag: the version you shared already has this exact check (if ($booking->payment_method !== 'qrph') { ... 409 ... }) placed before the claim logic. Same recommendation — confirm against live code.

[Medium] — SMS payment flow referenced but no webhook controllers present — not addressed, needs your input on whether this is dead code to remove or a missing deployment
